{"kelime":"يربوع","sozlukler":{"kaikki_vikisozluk":[{"w":"يربوع","u":"يربوع","p":"noun","h":"ar-noun","e":"يَرْبُوع • (yarbūʕ) m (plural يَرَابِيع (yarābīʕ))","t":"From Proto-Semitic *ʕakbar- (“mouse”) mingled with عُرْقُوب (ʕurqūb, “hamstring, Achilles tendon”) from *ʿarqūb- (“hamstring, Achilles tendon”) in specialization to the fauna of the Arabian desert where the jerboa is marked by its jumping muscles. Compare Classical Syriac ܥܽܘܩܒܪܳܐ (ʾuqbarā, “mouse”), Hebrew עַכְבָּר (ʾaḵbār, “mouse”).","s":[["inh","Proto-Semitic *ʕakbar- (“mouse”)"],["cog","Classical Syriac ܥܽܘܩܒܪܳܐ (ʾuqbarā, “mouse”)"],["cog","Hebrew עַכְבָּר (ʾaḵbār, “mouse”)"]],"g":["jerboa"],"r":["yarbūʕ"],"ipa":["/jar.buːʕ/"],"ds":[["ary","جربوع","jarbūʕ"],["ary","ݣربوع","garbūʕ"],["en","jerboa",""],["la","gerbo",""]],"el":[["*ʕakbar-","Reconstruction:Proto-Semitic/ʕakbar-"],["mouse","mouse"],["عُرْقُوب","عرقوب#Arabic"],["hamstring","hamstring"],["Achilles tendon","Achilles tendon"],["*ʿarqūb-","Reconstruction:Proto-Semitic/ʿarqūb-"],["hamstring","hamstring"],["Achilles tendon","Achilles tendon"],["ܥܽܘܩܒܪܳܐ","ܥܘܩܒܪܐ#Classical_Syriac"],["mouse","mouse"],["עַכְבָּר","עכבר#Hebrew"],["mouse","mouse"]],"yol":""}]}}